    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 1 · Session 2</span>\n<h2>Session 2 — Overview of AI/ML for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 1 · Buổi 2</span>\n<h2>Buổi 2 — Overview of AI/ML for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Overview of AI/ML for Cybersecurity<br><br>- Applied AI/ML in Cybersecurity<br><br>+ AI/ML in the Cybersecurity Domain<br><br>Typical Use Cases:<br>Intrusion Detection and Prevention Systems (IDS/IPS) and User and Entity Behavior Analytics (UEBA).<br>Phishing and spam detection.<br>Malware classification and profiling.<br>Anomaly detection in login logs and network traffic.<br>+ ML Integration Architecture in SOC/SIEM: Log sources → SIEM → ML model → Alert generation.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Chio2018] Chapter 1: Why Machine Learning and Security?<br>Cyber Threat Landscape; What Is Machine Learning?; What Machine Learning Is Not; Real-World Uses of Machine Learning in Security; Limitations of Machine Learning in Security.<br><br>[Alpaydin2020] 1 Introduction<br>1.1 What Is Machine Learning?; 1.2 Examples of Machine Learning Applications (Classification/Regression/Unsupervised); 1.4 Related Topics (Data Privacy and Security; Model Interpretability and Trust).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
