    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 1 · Session 5</span>\n<h2>Session 5 — Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 1 · Buổi 5</span>\n<h2>Buổi 5 — Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning<br>- Random Variables and Core Distributions<br><br>+ Random Variables: Introduction to Probability Mass Function (PMF), Probability Density Function (PDF), and Cumulative Distribution Function (CDF).<br><br>+ Multivariate Distributions: Joint, marginal, and conditional distributions.<br><br>- self learning: formal proofs of the PMF/PDF/CDF and joint-distribution formulas (class covers intuition only).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Alpaydin2020] Appendix A: Probability<br>A.1.1 Axioms of Probability; A.1.2 Conditional Probability<br>A.2.1 Probability Distribution and Density Functions; A.2.2 Joint Distribution…; A.2.3 Conditional Distributions; A.2.4 Bayes’ Rule; A.2.5 Expectation; A.2.6 Variance; A.2.7 Weak Law of Large Numbers<br>A.3.1 Bernoulli; A.3.2 Binomial; A.3.3 Multinomial; A.3.5 Normal (Gaussian)<br><br>[Alpaydin2020] 3 Bayesian Decision Theory: 3.2 Classification; 3.3 Losses and Risks; 3.4 Discriminant Functions.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
