    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 2 · Session 9</span>\n<h2>Session 9 — Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 2 · Buổi 9</span>\n<h2>Buổi 9 — Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Probability and Statistics for Machine Learning<br>- Resampling Techniques and Hypothesis Testing<br><br>+ Resampling Methods: Introduction to bootstrap and permutation techniques.<br><br>+ Hypothesis Testing: Basic principles of statistical hypothesis testing applied to machine learning models.<br><br>- self learning: permutation test &amp; in-depth Bayesian decision theory; statistical significance testing (moved to appendix).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Alpaydin2020] 4 Parametric Methods<br>4.2 Maximum Likelihood Estimation; 4.3 Evaluating an Estimator: Bias and Variance; 4.7 Tuning Model Complexity: Bias/Variance Dilemma; 4.8 Model Selection Procedures.<br><br>[Alpaydin2020] 20 Design and Analysis of Machine Learning Experiments<br>20.6 Cross-Validation and Resampling Methods (20.6.1 K-Fold; 20.6.3 Bootstrapping)<br>20.7 Measuring Classifier Performance; 20.8 Interval Estimation; 20.9 Hypothesis Testing<br>20.11 Comparing Two Classification Algorithms (20.11.1 McNemar; 20.11.2 Paired t-test; 20.11.3 5×2cv paired t-test).<br><br>[Chio2018] Chapter 2 → Practical Considerations in Classification: Choosing Thresholds and Comparing Models.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
