    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 3 · Session 14</span>\n<h2>Session 14 — Supervised Learning for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 3 · Buổi 14</span>\n<h2>Buổi 14 — Supervised Learning for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Supervised Learning for Cybersecurity<br>- Evaluation Metrics in Security Context<br><br>+ Standard Performance Metrics: Utilizing Confusion Matrix, Precision, Recall, F1-score, and ROC-AUC for model assessment.<br><br>+ Cost-Sensitive Metrics: Evaluating the operational impact of errors, with a specific emphasis on the high cost of False Positives in Security Operations Center (SOC) environments.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Chio2018] Chapter 2: Classifying and Clustering<br>Machine Learning: Problems and Approaches; Machine Learning in Practice: A Worked Example<br>Training Algorithms to Learn → (Model Families; Loss Functions; Optimization)<br>Practical Considerations in Classification → (Training Data Construction; Feature Selection; Overfitting and Underfitting; Choosing Thresholds and Comparing Models).<br><br>[Alpaydin2020] 2 Supervised Learning<br>2.1 Learning a Class from Examples; 2.4 Noise; 2.5 Learning Multiple Classes; 2.7 Model Selection and Generalization.<br><br>[Alpaydin2020] 20.7 Measuring Classifier Performance.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
