    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 7 · Session 35</span>\n<h2>Session 35 — Model Evaluation and Imbalanced Data</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 7 · Buổi 35</span>\n<h2>Buổi 35 — Model Evaluation and Imbalanced Data</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Model Evaluation and Imbalanced Data<br>- The Accuracy Paradox and Advanced Evaluation Curves<br><br>+ Accuracy vs. Alternative Metrics: Comparing traditional accuracy against other performance indicators.<br><br>+ The Imbalance Pitfall: Understanding why accuracy is a dangerous and misleading metric when evaluating highly imbalanced classes.<br><br>+ Performance Visualization: Utilizing Receiver Operating Characteristic - Area Under Curve (ROC-AUC) and Precision-Recall (PR) curves for robust model evaluation.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Alpaydin2020] Chapter 20<br>20.7 Measuring Classifier Performance; 20.8 Interval Estimation<br>20.10 Assessing a Classification Algorithm’s Performance (20.10.1 Binomial Test; 20.10.2 Approx Normal Test; 20.10.3 t Test)<br>20.11 Comparing Two Classification Algorithms (20.11.1 McNemar; 20.11.2 K-Fold CV paired t test).<br><br>[Chio2018] Chapter 2 → Practical Considerations: Choosing Thresholds and Comparing Models.<br><br>[Halder2018] Chapter 10<br>Imbalanced data; Handling imbalanced datasets (Under/Over-sampling; SMOTE…);<br>Investigating precision-recall curve and area; Predictions… confusion matrix.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
