    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 8 · Session 37</span>\n<h2>Session 37 — Detailed Analysis and Evaluation: The IDS Case Study</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 8 · Buổi 37</span>\n<h2>Buổi 37 — Detailed Analysis and Evaluation: The IDS Case Study</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO5, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO5, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Detailed Analysis and Evaluation: The IDS Case Study<br>- IDS Paradigms and the Role of ML<br><br>+ Signature-based vs. Anomaly-based IDS: Analyzing the specific advantages and disadvantages of each detection approach.<br><br>+ Machine Learning Integration: Understanding the distinct roles and applications of machine learning within both signature and anomaly-based systems.<br><br>+ Emerging Threats: Addressing the continuous challenge of newly emerging attack vectors (zero-day attacks).<br><br>- self learnin: Exploratory Data Analysis, encoding, scalling, correlation; RFE</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Chio2018] Chapter 5 → Building a Predictive Model to Classify Network Attacks<br>Exploring the Data; Data Preparation; Classification; Supervised Learning; Semi-Supervised Learning; Unsupervised Learning; Advanced Ensembling.<br><br>Optional<br><br>[Chio2018] Chapter 3: Response and Mitigation; Practical System Design Concerns.<br><br>[Halder2018] Chapter 6: Model evaluation; Choosing k for k-means; Normalizing features (nếu có so sánh anomaly-based IDS).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
