    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chapter 10 · Session 49</span>\n<h2>Session 49 — LLMs and Agentic AI for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Chương 10 · Buổi 49</span>\n<h2>Buổi 49 — LLMs and Agentic AI for Cybersecurity</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>LLMs and Agentic AI for Cybersecurity<br>- Introduction to LLMs and Agentic AI in Security Operations<br><br>+ Overview: The role of LLMs and Agentic AI in cybersecurity, focusing on alert analysis, incident investigation, and response automation.<br><br>+ SOC/IR Use Cases: Exploring common applications within Security Operations Centers (SOC) and Incident Response (IR), including alert triage, threat hunting, playbook generation, and automated reporting.<br><br>- self learning: Market/model landscape; MoE/GQA/MLA/RoPE/sparse attention; vendor products; long jailbreak lists; repeated training poisoning; detailed EU AI Act; MCP implementation; framework comparison; multi-agent/autonomous SOC; open-vs-closed comparison.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>[Bodungen2023] Chapter 1<br>Creating an API Key and interacting with OpenAI; Basic Prompting…; Applying ChatGPT Roles…;<br>Enhancing Output with Templates…; Sending API Requests and Handling Responses with Python; Using Prompt Variables….<br><br>[Bodungen2023] Chapter 7: Threat Monitoring and Detection<br>Threat Intelligence Analysis; Real-Time Log Analysis; Building Custom Threat Detection Rules;<br>Network Traffic Analysis and Anomaly Detection with PCAP Analyzer.<br><br>Optional (Agentic / automation / IR use-cases)<br><br>[Bodungen2023] Chapter 8: Incident Response<br>ChatGPT-assisted incident analysis and triage; Generating incident response playbooks;<br>Automated briefing reports and incident timeline reconstruction (+ Notes of caution).<br><br>[Bodungen2023] Chapter 9<br>Local threat hunting with Open Interpreter; Implementing local AI models… with LMStudio; Reviewing IR Plans with PrivateGPT.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read the materials beforehand, attend classes, and fulfill the instructor's requirements.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
