    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Lab</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Lab</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">120' - 180'/each</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Practice hands-onDialogue-based assessment with self-directed learning.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">technical aspect of studied topics</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Guided by instructor<br><br>- 2 Labs<br><br>- Student must finish labs and submit the results to the instructor in class.<br><br>- Combines dialogue-based assessment with self-directed learning.<br><br>- An average point of all labs could be evaluated and published to students at the end of the semester.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The lab report content can be obtained from the lab manual, or created by the instructor to align with the chapters.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
