    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Assessment 2/4</span>\n<h2>Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14523 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">AIC211 · Đầu điểm 2/4</span>\n<h2>Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14523 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">60'/each</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">Test 1: CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5; Test 2: CLO6, CLO7, CLO8, CLO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Multiple choicesMarked by Computer or a suitable format</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">50/each</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">in class, by instructor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Instruction and schedules for Progress Tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has responsibility to review the test for students after graded.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 33 — Progress Test 01</li><li>Session 40 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Session 41 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Session 42 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Session 54 — Progress Test 02</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 33 — Progress Test 01</li><li>Buổi 40 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Buổi 41 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Buổi 42 — LAB 2: Security data pipeline + IDS + imbalance</li><li>Buổi 54 — Progress Test 02</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
